    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You are the best of this lot.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield high-tech firearms, rockets, and lasers against incoming enemy hordes! This action Roguelike hinges on pivotal &quot;Quest Param&quot; choices that forge your path to power. Unearth ancient artifacts that unlock revolutionary combat tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aMugen RPG\u300b</strong> is a top-down, fast-paced action Roguelike game. As a newcomer struggling to survive, you'll be thrown into a life-or-death trial across different worlds. Relying on cutting-edge weaponry and the emergent enhancements found in battle, you must fight through a hail of bullets against tides of enemies and formidable bosses. Every adventure is a fresh start. Acquire &quot;Quest Params&quot; through combat and freely construct your unique fighting style. Will you become a master of firepower clearing screens in an instant, or an unshakeable bastion on the battlefield? Your choices define everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Core Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Build Possibilities:</strong> A vast array of &quot;Quest Params&quot; offers endless combinations to create your ultimate combat form.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Fire, Focus on Strategy:</strong> Weapons attack automatically, letting you concentrate on movement, decision-making, and high-skill maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the Unknown:</strong> Encounter diverse enemy swarms with distinct behaviors and uniquely designed powerful Bosses. Every encounter is a new test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Artifacts, Turn the Tide:</strong> Find and wield ancient creations holding mysterious powers; they will bring unexpected variables and aid to your adventures.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You are the best of this lot.&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield high-tech firearms, rockets, and lasers against incoming enemy hordes! This action Roguelike hinges on pivotal &quot;Quest Param&quot; choices that forge your path to power. Unearth ancient artifacts that unlock revolutionary combat tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aMugen RPG\u300b</strong> is a top-down, fast-paced action Roguelike game. As a newcomer struggling to survive, you'll be thrown into a life-or-death trial across different worlds. Relying on cutting-edge weaponry and the emergent enhancements found in battle, you must fight through a hail of bullets against tides of enemies and formidable bosses. Every adventure is a fresh start. Acquire &quot;Quest Params&quot; through combat and freely construct your unique fighting style. Will you become a master of firepower clearing screens in an instant, or an unshakeable bastion on the battlefield? Your choices define everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Core Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Build Possibilities:</strong> A vast array of &quot;Quest Params&quot; offers endless combinations to create your ultimate combat form.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Auto-Fire, Focus on Strategy:</strong> Weapons attack automatically, letting you concentrate on movement, decision-making, and high-skill maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge the Unknown:</strong> Encounter diverse enemy swarms with distinct behaviors and uniquely designed powerful Bosses. Every encounter is a new test.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious Artifacts, Turn the Tide:</strong> Find and wield ancient creations holding mysterious powers; they will bring unexpected variables and aid to your adventures.</p></li></ul>",
